{"id":52215,"mal_id":52215,"title":"Chi. Chikyuu no Undou ni Tsuite","englishTitle":"Orb: On the Movements of the Earth","title_english":"Orb: On the Movements of the Earth","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["About the Movement of the Earth"],"en":"Orb: On the Movements of the Earth","ja":"チ。―地球の運動について―"},"synopsis":"Twelve-year-old prodigy Rafal believes in living rationally, so as to earn praise and respect from society while not being led astray by his emotions. To this end, he publicly states his intention to study theology—the academic field held in highest regard in early 15th century Poland. However, an encounter with a mysterious man upends Rafal's life, sparking an illogical desire to instead pursue his passion for astronomy.\n\nRafal is determined to prove the beauty and rationality of heliocentrism—the theory that the Earth revolves around the Sun. This belief is considered heretical by the powerful Church, which promotes geocentrism—the Sun revolving around the Earth—as the sole truth of the universe. Those whose beliefs do not align with the will of the Church suffer unfathomably gruesome consequences.\n\nIn pursuit of evidence for a heliocentric model of the universe, Rafal grapples with obtaining precise calculations and building empirical theories. His greatest challenge, however, lies in conducting this research discreetly—lest he wish to meet the same fate as other heretics.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Rafal, un niño prodigio de doce años, cree en vivir racionalmente, para ganarse el elogio y el respeto de la sociedad sin dejarse llevar por sus emociones. Con este fin, declara públicamente su intención de estudiar teología, el campo académico más respetado en la Polonia de principios del siglo XV. Sin embargo, un encuentro con un hombre misterioso trastorna la vida de Rafal, provocando un deseo ilógico de dedicarse a su pasión por la astronomía.\n\nRafal está decidido a demostrar la belleza y la racionalidad del heliocentrismo: la teoría de que la Tierra gira alrededor del Sol. Esta creencia es considerada herética por la poderosa Iglesia, que promueve el geocentrismo (el Sol gira alrededor de la Tierra) como la única verdad del universo. Aquellos cuyas creencias no se alinean con la voluntad de la Iglesia sufren consecuencias insondablemente espantosas.\n\nEn busca de evidencia para un modelo heliocéntrico del universo, Rafal lucha por obtener cálculos precisos y construir teorías empíricas. Su mayor desafío, sin embargo, radica en realizar esta investigación discretamente, no sea que desee correr la misma suerte que otros herejes.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1500,"average_episode_duration":1500,"startDate":"2024-10-05","start_date":"2024-10-05","endDate":"2025-03-15","end_date":"2025-03-15","season":"fall","year":2024,"start_season":{"year":2024,"season":"fall"},"episodes":25,"num_episodes":25,"score":8.72,"mean":8.72,"numListUsers":329292,"num_list_users":329292,"genres":[{"id":8,"name":"Drama"},{"id":13,"name":"Historical"},{"id":42,"name":"Seinen"}],"studios":[{"id":11,"name":"Madhouse"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/o5GDX8zmKLpOxRkBoAonoQL8gbg.jpg","logo_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9G0REfRD39gP51RHRs7zwsz1nXb.png","tmdb_id":"204635","tmdb_updated_at":"2026-11-21T22:34:15.013Z","images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1749/145922.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1749/145922l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1749/145922.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1749/145922l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1749/145922l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"saturday","time":"23:45","day_of_the_week":"saturday","start_time":"23:45","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"saturday 23:45"},"rank":56,"pop